# The race benchmark: boot-to-race.pad, then the player's car follows the
# route the leading opponent drove in this race (sunset-and-vine.route, made
# with route.py) for 90 s of game time. Segments: as boot-to-race.pad, then
# race (from the start, 0x827D7510 being the game's timer since the race
# loaded) and race_end. Under --mcla_fixed_dt=60 every run gives the same
# inputs for the same game state (devrun.py bench --fixed-dt 60).
include boot-to-race.pad
# Throttle held through the countdown; every car's position once a second of
# game time in the log (devrun.py bench compares runs with them).
follow sunset-and-vine.route
watch 60
wait_until f32 0x827D7510 >= 9.3 60s
mark race
wait 5400f
mark race_end
follow stop
watch stop
